section("Data"); add("# Mood Prediction from Menstrual Cycle Data: Ridge Regression, Optimization and Bayesian Methods from Scratch\n")
add("*PAI103 project report (learning project, not a medical tool). Every number below is loaded from the saved result files by `src/build_report.py`; see `docs/numbers_provenance.md`. The authors' published values appear only where labelled **authors' reported (reference only)**. Extension sections (Phase 7) can be added as markdown files in `docs/extensions/`; they are inserted at the marker near the end.*\n")
